{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And if water be put.</b> That they water the field and some of their carcass falls on the seed. And some say: on the water. And the word יותן proves that it is singular with מים, and likewise מי נדה — one does not sprinkle it on him. And the word יותן is like יוקח נא מעט מים, from the heavy (hifil) conjugation."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:37.658376052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}